UPDATE firms SET about = 'Stikeman Elliott LLP is a Canadian business law firm founded in 1952, structured as a partnership and headquartered in Canada with a complement in the 1,001 to 5,000 employee range. The firm practises across banking, securities, competition, finance, employment and labour, tax, litigation, mergers and acquisitions, mining, restructuring and general business law, and works in both English and French. Its Toronto office anchors the firm''s corporate and capital markets work. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, Stikeman Elliott LLP is highlighted for anyone browsing Toronto-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'stikeman-elliott-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Daniel Brown Law LLP is a Toronto criminal defence boutique founded in 2008 by Daniel Brown, who is certified as a specialist in criminal law by the Law Society of Ontario, a designation held by fewer than two percent of criminal lawyers in the province. The partnership runs a team of roughly 11 to 50 people out of Toronto, and concentrates on criminal charges, impaired and over-80 driving charges, assault charges, bail hearings and criminal appeals. It has repeatedly been named among Canada''s leading criminal law boutiques by Canadian Lawyer Magazine and the Globe and Mail. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, Daniel Brown Law LLP is highlighted for anyone browsing Toronto-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'daniel-brown-law-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Oatley Vigmond Personal Injury Lawyers LLP is a partnership headquartered in Barrie, Ontario, in the 51 to 200 employee range, practising exclusively in personal injury law and accident benefits. The firm acts for people who have suffered serious and catastrophic injuries, and handles both the tort claim against the at-fault party and the accident benefits claim against the injured person''s own insurer. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, Oatley Vigmond is highlighted for anyone browsing Barrie-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'oatley-vigmond-personal-injury-lawyers-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Founded in 1860, WeirFoulds is one of Canada''s oldest law firms and one of Ontario''s established regional practices. The firm concentrates on four core areas: litigation, corporate, property and government law, with more than half of its lawyers practising before courts and tribunals. WeirFoulds is regularly ranked among Canadian Lawyer''s Top 10 Ontario Regional Firms and is recognized as one of the province''s leading real estate and municipal law practices. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, WeirFoulds LLP is highlighted for anyone browsing Toronto-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'weirfoulds-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Torys is an international business law firm founded in Toronto in 1941, with additional offices in New York, Calgary, Montreal and a legal services centre in Halifax. The firm''s practice spans mergers and acquisitions, capital markets, litigation, competition law and corporate restructuring, and it is known for a nationwide disputes practice that includes some of the country''s most sophisticated litigators. Torys regularly advises on major cross-border and domestic transactions for Canadian and international clients. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, Torys LLP is highlighted for anyone browsing Toronto-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'torys-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Dentons Canada traces its roots back to 1839 and is part of Dentons, one of the largest law firm networks in the world. The Canadian practice operates from six of the country''s major economic centres, including Toronto, Calgary, Ottawa and Montreal, and offers full-service coverage across more than 40 practice areas in both common and civil law. The firm is recognized on the Thomson Reuters Global Elite Law Firm Brand Index for its client service and cross-border capability. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, Dentons Canada LLP is highlighted for anyone browsing Toronto-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'dentons-canada-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Norton Rose Fulbright is a global law firm with its Canadian headquarters in Toronto and additional offices in Calgary, Montreal, Ottawa, Quebec City and Vancouver. The Canadian practice is best known for its energy, infrastructure and resources group, one of the largest of its kind in the world, advising on projects spanning oil and gas, power, mining and renewables. The firm also maintains strong financial institutions, technology and transport practices across its more than 600 Canadian lawyers. Norton Rose Fulbright Canada LLP is a Featured Partner on LawDB, meaning it appears with priority placement for people searching for a lawyer in Toronto and the surrounding area.' WHERE slug = 'norton-rose-fulbright-canada-llp' AND about IS NULL;
UPDATE firms SET about = 'Known as Blakes, this firm has served Canadian and international businesses for more than 150 years from offices including Toronto, Calgary, Vancouver, Ottawa, Montreal, New York and London. Blakes is particularly well regarded for mergers and acquisitions, banking and finance, and commercial litigation, and its lawyers are consistently ranked among the top advisers on Canadian M&A league tables by Bloomberg, Thomson Reuters and Mergermarket. As a Featured Partner on LawDB, Blake, Cassels & Graydon LLP is highlighted for anyone browsing Toronto-area law firms.' WHERE slug = 'blake-cassels-graydon-llp' AND about IS NULL;
